   "use": "Adjectives agree in gender and number with the noun. Most add -e for the feminine (petit → petite, froid → froide), and the final consonant then becomes audible: petit “puh-TEE”, petite “puh-TEET”. Learn the special endings: -eux → -euse, -il → -ille, -el → -elle, doux → douce, gros → grosse. Beau has a third form, bel, before a masculine word starting with a vowel: un bel homme.",
