   "modelEn": "In my view, it isn’t that simple. On the one hand, when it’s warm all year round you can go out, head to the beach and exercise outdoors — that’s the case in the Philippines, for instance. On the other hand, the seasons have their advantages too. In Canada, autumn is stunning, and in winter the snow means you can go skiing. What’s more, the heat can make working hard going. All in all, I believe every climate has its merits, but personally I rather enjoy the change of seasons.",
