   "modelEn": "Hi everyone! I’ve just booked a table at Chez Léon for Paul’s birthday. It’s on Saturday 12 October at 8 p.m. The restaurant is next to the station, on rue Victor Hugo. The full set menu is twenty-one euros. Paul has no idea — it’s a surprise, so don’t tell him! Please let me know as soon as you can. Speak soon, Mariz",
   "sound": "sah-LEW too luh MOHND ! zhuh vee-AN duh ray-zehr-VAY ewn TAH-bluh oh res-toh-RAHN shay lay-OHN poor lah-nee-vehr-SEHR duh POL. seh luh sahm-DEE dooz ok-TOH-bruh ah van TUHR. luh res-toh-RAHN eh tah koh-TAY duh lah GAHR, rew veek-TOR ew-GOH. luh muh-NEW kohn-PLET koot van tay uh nuh-ROH. pol nuh seh ree-AN : seh tewn sewr-PREEZ, ah-LOR nuh lwee deet PAH ! ray-pohn-day MWAH deh kuh poh-SEE-bluh, seel voo PLEH. ah bee-an-TOH, mah-REEZ"
